ant removals from Inbox but retention.\n- DELETE (Gmail): Moves messages to Trash; recoverable from Trash for up to 30 days; then permanently deleted. If this mailbox is not Gmail, deletion behavior may be permanent immediately — please confirm provider if not Gmail.\n- I cannot determine how many messages would be affected until I run a non-destructive search/count.\n\nQuestions I need you to answer (please reply with your choices):\n1) Exact target mailbox/account (email address) or label to operate on:\n2) Operation: ARCHIVE or DELETE (DELETE will move to Trash; confirm you understand Trash retention limits):\n3) Date cutoff confirmation: Use messages received before 2025-09-04 (older than one year). OK? (yes/no)\n4) Threads: Remove only the matching messages, or remove entire conversation threads that include any matching message? (messages / whole-threads)\n5) Sender matching: Match only when billing@acme-cloud.example is the exact From address, or also when it appears in CC/BCC? (From-only / any-recipient-field)\n6) Exceptions: Do you want to exclude starred, unread, labeled, or messages with attachments? If yes, list exclusions.\n7) Do you want me to first run a non-destructive search to report how many matching messages there are before performing the operation? (yes/no)\n8) If DELETE is chosen: confirm you accept that deletion will be irreversible after the provider’s retention (e.g., 30 days for Gmail Trash). Reply “I confirm delete” to authorize.\n\nI will not run any searches or make changes until you reply with all answers above and give explicit confirmation.","type":"output_text"}],"id":"msg_0a0959cf85d42eef016a9a6e89aa2887d097baf40da79499b0","role":"assistant","status":"completed","type":"message"}],"parallel_tool_calls":true,"presence_penalty":0.0,"previous_response_id":null,"prompt_cache_key":null,"prompt_cache_retention":"in_memory","reasoning":{"context":"current_turn","effort":"medium","mode":"standard","summary":null},"safety_identifier":null,"